Package: featdelta
Type: Package
Title: Incremental Feature Engineering with Database Persistence
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Rudolfs", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "rudolfs.kregers@gmail.com")
Author: Rudolfs [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Rudolfs <rudolfs.kregers@gmail.com>
Description: Define feature logic in R, compute only new or unprocessed
    rows, and persist the resulting flat feature table in a database.
    The package provides an explicit incremental pipeline for fetching
    source rows, computing feature definitions, and upserting computed
    features back to a database table.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
